{"type":"standard","title":"Nick Begich III","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Nick Begich III</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q113676482","titles":{"canonical":"Nick_Begich_III","normalized":"Nick Begich III","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Nick Begich III</span></span>"},"pageid":77970759,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Nick_Begich_III_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-Nick_Begich_III_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Nick_Begich_III_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1370892029","tid":"db6ee672-9f0f-11f1-b837-3ce3d2a19ef8","timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:29:48Z","description":"American politician and businessman (born 1977)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Begich_III","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Begich_III?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Begich_III?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Nick_Begich_III"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Begich_III","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Nick_Begich_III","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Begich_III?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Nick_Begich_III"}},"extract":"Nicholas Joseph Begich III is an American politician and businessman who has served as the U.S. representative for Alaska's at-large congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he had previously run for the seat in the 2022 special and regular elections before his election in 2024.","extract_html":"<p><b>Nicholas Joseph Begich III</b> is an American politician and businessman who has served as the U.S. representative for Alaska's at-large congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he had previously run for the seat in the 2022 special and regular elections before his election in 2024.</p>"}